OL,3,ATrump says Ukraine and Russia agree
OL,4,A'energy ceasefire' but both sides yet
OL,5,Ato comment
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says Ukraine and Russia
OL,8,Fhave agreed to an immediate "energy
OL,9,Fceasefire", without providing further
OL,10,Fdetails
OL,12,FIn a social media post, Trump claims
OL,13,F"both parties have agreed" - neither
OL,14,Fhas commented publicly
OL,16,FIt comes after Ukraine's President
OL,17,FVolodymyr Zelensky condemned Donald
OL,18,FTrump's announcement of a deal to
OL,19,Fimport Russian diesel into the US,
OL,20,Fcalling it a "gift" to President Putin
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
